  "goodToKnow": "Der Mehrwert is added value: einen echten Mehrwert bieten, a favourite in business presentations. Die Mehrwertsteuer (MwSt.) is VAT, 19 percent in Germany, with a reduced rate of 7 percent for most food and books; officially it's die Umsatzsteuer. In Marx's Das Kapital, written in German, Mehrwert is surplus value, the core of his theory of exploitation. It has no plural."
